==Other Appearances==
==={{ZA|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
[[File:ZA Dragonfly Sprite.png|left|A Dragonfly in Zelda's Adventure]]
In {{ZA}}, Dragonflies appear as enemies. Their appearance is more closely based on their real world namesake. They are rather weak and can be easily defeated by any of [[Zelda]]'s weapons. They also have a high tendency of dropping [[Heart]]s when defeated. Dragonflies are first encountered in the [[Shrine of Air]], but later also appear in the [[Vision Henge]] when [[Malmord]] combusts into a swarm of Dragonflies after being struck. These Dragonflies are notably the only enemies in the Vision Henge that will drop Hearts.
